      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is i tried those things. i go for walks or touch stuff but it just feels like i'm looking at life through a window. like i'm a ghost watching people live. it's not even scary anymore, it's just... empty. i feel like if i just stopped, the world wouldn't even notice the gap. like there's nothing to actually lose.",
